  "description": "Give your designs a soft and playful finish with this chocoberry horizontal stripe seamless pattern. The delicious combination of chocolate brown and strawberry pink creates a warm, sweet palette inspired by chocolate-covered berries, pastel confectionery, and romantic coquette aesthetics. Featuring classic horizontal bands, this repeating background feels both timeless and trendy, making it a lovely choice for feminine branding, cute stationery, gift packaging, and Valentine’s Day projects. Add a touch of cozy sweetness to your digital creations and handmade products with this charming pink-and-brown design.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Coquette-inspired invitations and greeting cards\n•Valentine’s Day gift wrap and packaging\n•Bakery branding and chocolate-themed products\n•Girly planners, journals, and scrapbook layouts\n•Fashion accessories and fabric printing\n•Birthday decorations and party stationery\n•Digital backgrounds and website graphics\n•Cute stickers, labels, and printable crafts",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Give your designs a soft and playful finish with this chocoberry horizontal stripe seamless pattern. The delicious combination of chocolate brown and strawberry pink creates a warm, sweet palette inspired by chocolate-covered berries, pastel confectionery, and romantic coquette aesthetics. Featuring classic horizontal bands, this repeating background feels both timeless and trendy, making it a lovely choice for feminine branding, cute stationery, gift packaging, and Valentine’s Day projects. Add a touch of cozy sweetness to your digital creations and handmade products with this charming pink-and-brown design.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n•15 seamless patterns<br>\n•Format: JPEG<br>\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n•High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n•Coquette-inspired invitations and greeting cards<br>\n•Valentine’s Day gift wrap and packaging<br>\n•Bakery branding and chocolate-themed products<br>\n•Girly planners, journals, and scrapbook layouts<br>\n•Fashion accessories and fabric printing<br>\n•Birthday decorations and party stationery<br>\n•Digital backgrounds and website graphics<br>\n•Cute stickers, labels, and printable crafts</p>",
